{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、全く音ゲーとか\nゲームアプリやってないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト勉強前の学生みたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちょうど\nもうすぐ期末テスト\nって時期かな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、とゆーことで\n今日は取材とか撮影とかリハとか\n1日お仕事がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材の方は\n発売近くなったらまた告知します(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして告知と言えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『日経エンタテインメント!アイドルSpecial2015』が\nおととい発売されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙は選抜なのが目印です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙は選抜だけだけど\n中はアンダーメンバー、\nさらには研究生も載ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、個別インタビューで\n1人につき、まるまる２ページも！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わお！革命的！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂好きなら読むしか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言いつつも\n実は中田、まだ読めてないから\n明日にはもらいにいってきます`・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の取材であった差し入れ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに\nこのお菓子いただくんだけど\nうまぺろ(๑>؂<๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はかなり甘党"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"砂糖依存性こわい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ブログのタイトルは\n755で募集して\nランダムで選ばせてもらってるから\n『カナしいたけ』は中田の言葉ではないよ！\nむしろ、サバンナ八木さんのギャグです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、結構いろんなもの試したい人で\n頻繁に新しく出たの買うんだけど\n結局元に戻すこと多い(´・ω・`)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルの特典映像がアップされました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『生のアイドルが好き#20特典映像！～2014年を一文字で表すと...』\nhttp://youtu.be/Q6h-CE0am9o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pigoo限定オフショットとも別なので\nオフショット見てくださったかたも\n見てね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にオフショットの方は\n見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田的にオフショットは毎回\nMCってこと忘れて\n結構楽しんでやってるけど\n今回は本当に遊んじゃってるw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも\nチェックよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/12/04/0293088/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブFINALまであと1週間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}